Output docs/demo.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono, Menlo, monospace"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1080
Set Height 720
Set Padding 22
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 28ms
Set Framerate 10

Type "node dist/cli.js --help"
Enter
Sleep 3.5s

Type "clear && npm run demo"
Enter
Sleep 12s
